   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Evil Star**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Mr. Beat**: back after 30 archived shows (983 days) [2]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Float Along - Fill Your Lungs [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-live-in-london-19-audio** (recommended): source not stated; 17 songs; 90 min [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Ambrose Kenny-Smith played harmonica, vocals, keys, and percussion [1]\n- Stu Mackenzie performed vocals, guitar, and keys [1]\n- The performance occurred at Alexandra Palace in London on October 5th, 2019 [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-live-in-london-19-audio**: Sam Joseph, Stacey Wilson, and Gaspard De Meulemeester recorded the audio [1]",
